1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,248
两个目录，都叫 cheese dataset，文件名一样，数量也一样
Two folders, both called cheese_dataset, with the same file names and the same count.

2
00:00:05,568 --> 00:00:08,277
周一你在其中一个上训练了模型
On Monday you trained a model on one of them.

3
00:00:08,597 --> 00:00:12,075
周五模型变差了，可谁都没动过代码
On Friday the model got worse, and nobody touched the code.

4
00:00:12,395 --> 00:00:15,488
那么，这个模型看到的是哪些照片、带着哪些 label？
So which photos, with which labels, did that model see?

5
00:00:15,808 --> 00:00:17,813
还能把它们一模一样地拿回来吗？
And can you get exactly those back?

6
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:20,607
我们大多数人靠文件名来回答
Most of us answer with file names:

7
00:00:20,607 --> 00:00:24,067
final、final 第 2 版、final final 第 3 版
final, final version 2, final final version 3,

8
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:26,925
直到没人知道哪个才是 final
until nobody knows which one is final.

9
00:00:27,167 --> 00:00:29,770
更好的答案是：一行字
Here is a better answer: one short line.

10
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:33,085
第二部分里，你会算出这个一模一样的字符串
In part 2 you will compute this exact string

11
00:00:33,085 --> 00:00:35,807
就在自己的笔记本上，用 4 张奶酪照片
on your own laptop from 4 cheese photos.

12
00:00:36,127 --> 00:00:40,671
它会和授课老师在课程 repo 里打的 tag 对上，一个字符都不差
It will match the instructor's tag in the class repo, character for character.

13
00:00:40,991 --> 00:00:44,959
一行字，怎么能锁定大约 600 KB 的照片？
How can one line pin down about 600 kilobytes of photos?

14
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:49,488
在那之前，有人点了 gouda，这个词到底去了哪儿？
And before that, when someone clicks gouda, where does that word actually go?

15
00:00:49,733 --> 00:00:52,249
跟着做，你需要：Docker Desktop
To follow along you need Docker Desktop,

16
00:00:52,249 --> 00:00:55,730
一个开通了结算的 Google Cloud 项目和你自己的 bucket
a Google Cloud project with billing and your own bucket,

17
00:00:55,730 --> 00:00:57,330
还有一个 GitHub 账号
and a GitHub account.

18
00:00:57,413 --> 00:01:02,085
这一讲会在云端存几 MB 数据，金色标签会标出在哪儿
This lecture stores a few megabytes in the cloud, and gold tags mark where.

19
00:01:02,405 --> 00:01:05,285
左上角的进度条跟着两份 README 走
The tracker in the top left follows both READMEs.

20
00:01:05,605 --> 00:01:08,758
看到黄色的 your turn 标签，就暂停，自己跑一遍
A yellow your-turn tag means pause and run it;

21
00:01:08,758 --> 00:01:12,666
灰色的 extra 标签表示这个检查 README 里没有
a gray extra tag marks a check that is not in the README.

22
00:01:12,986 --> 00:01:15,120
每条命令都在学习指南里
Every command is in the study guide.

23
00:01:16,167 --> 00:01:17,546
先看地图
First, the map.

24
00:01:17,596 --> 00:01:21,701
课上先画未标注的奶酪照片，再画标注好的
The lecture draws unlabeled cheese photos, then labeled ones,

25
00:01:21,701 --> 00:01:24,999
然后是训练，中间的箭头在问怎么做到
then training, and the arrow in between asks how.

26
00:01:25,319 --> 00:01:29,692
这些 label 就是 ground truth：模型从中学习，也拿它来评分
Labels are the ground truth a model learns from and is graded against.

27
00:01:30,012 --> 00:01:34,386
模型犯的错，标注之后，会进入下一个数据集版本
The model's mistakes, once labeled, go into the next dataset version.

28
00:01:34,634 --> 00:01:38,659
下面是这一讲要搭的两个站。第一部分是标注站
Underneath, the two stations this lecture builds. Part 1

29
00:01:38,659 --> 00:01:43,315
Label Studio 和一个小小的命令行 container
is the labeling station: Label Studio and a small command line container,

30
00:01:43,315 --> 00:01:45,983
再加一个放照片和 label 的 bucket
with one bucket for photos and labels.

31
00:01:46,303 --> 00:01:50,190
第二部分是版本管理站：一个 DVC container、一个有
Part 2 is the versioning station: one DVC container,

32
00:01:50,190 --> 00:01:53,778
两个目录的 bucket、你自己的 GitHub repo
a bucket with two folders, your own GitHub repo,

33
00:01:53,778 --> 00:01:55,797
还有用来查看版本的 Colab
and Colab to view versions.

34
00:01:56,117 --> 00:02:00,212
代码还没把这两半连起来；练习 E7 会连
The code does not connect the halves yet; exercise E7 does.

35
00:02:00,450 --> 00:02:02,562
现在来做课上的回顾小测
Now, the lecture's recall quiz.

36
00:02:02,882 --> 00:02:06,095
Docker 网络、云端凭据、Docker Compose
Docker network, cloud credentials, Docker Compose:

37
00:02:06,095 --> 00:02:08,280
今天它们各自会出现在哪里？
where will each one show up today?

38
00:02:17,117 --> 00:02:21,448
有了网络，命令行 container 就能按名字调用 Label Studio
The network lets the command line container call Label Studio by name.

39
00:02:21,768 --> 00:02:25,821
凭据就是一个密钥文件，挂载进每个 container
The credentials are one key file, mounted into every container.

40
00:02:26,141 --> 00:02:28,829
Compose 则是 README 的 Extra 一节
And Compose is the README's extra section,

41
00:02:28,829 --> 00:02:31,261
它把两个 container 一起启动
which starts both containers together.

42
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:34,371
把 data-labeling 这个 repo clone 下来，再进去
Clone the data-labeling repo and move into it;

43
00:02:34,371 --> 00:02:35,845
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
pause and run it.

44
00:02:35,895 --> 00:02:40,304
给 Docker 超过 4 GB 的内存，README 是这么要求的
Give Docker more than 4 gigabytes of memory, as the README asks;

45
00:02:40,304 --> 00:02:43,404
这个设置现在在 Settings 的 Resources 下面
the setting is now under Settings, Resources.

46
00:02:43,650 --> 00:02:47,371
额外跑一下 git log，能看到这个视频用的 commit
An extra git log shows this video's commit,

47
00:02:47,371 --> 00:02:48,929
是 2025 年 10 月的
from October 2025;

48
00:02:48,929 --> 00:02:54,296
再额外列一下目录，有几个脚本、cli.py 和三张图
an extra listing shows the scripts, cli.py and three pictures.

49
00:02:57,584 --> 00:03:01,894
接下来是 secrets 目录，放在 repo 旁边，绝不放在里面
Next, the secrets folder, beside the repo and never inside it;

50
00:03:01,894 --> 00:03:03,771
今天两个 repo 都用它
it serves both repos today.

51
00:03:04,091 --> 00:03:07,738
暂停一下，建好它；额外用 tree 看一下，和 README 一致
Pause and make it; an extra tree view matches the README.

52
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,515
现在是密钥
Now the key.

53
00:03:15,565 --> 00:03:18,098
在控制台里，建一个服务账号
In the console, create a service account

54
00:03:18,098 --> 00:03:21,645
名字叫 data-service-account，角色是 Storage Admin
named data-service-account, with the Storage Admin role.

55
00:03:21,965 --> 00:03:26,295
然后建一个 JSON 密钥，存进你的 secrets 目录
Then create one JSON key, saved in your secrets folder

56
00:03:26,295 --> 00:03:28,621
文件名是 data-service-account.json
as data-service-account.json.

57
00:03:28,941 --> 00:03:33,379
这个角色的权限比需要的大：它覆盖项目里的每一个 bucket
This role is broader than needed: it covers every bucket in the project.

58
00:03:33,699 --> 00:03:35,299
暂停一下，建一个你自己的
Pause and create yours.

59
00:03:35,450 --> 00:03:38,096
额外列一下目录，密钥已经就位
An extra listing shows the key in place:

60
00:03:38,096 --> 00:03:41,338
这是一个替身，到 Source storage 那一步再解释
a stand-in, explained at the Source storage step.

61
00:03:41,583 --> 00:03:44,921
从 README 的链接下载未标注的照片
Download the unlabeled photos from the README link;

62
00:03:44,921 --> 00:03:47,343
我们用 curl，用浏览器也行
we use curl, and a browser works too.

63
00:03:47,663 --> 00:03:49,263
然后解压这个 zip
Then extract the zip.

64
00:03:49,412 --> 00:03:50,962
暂停一下，两件都做了
Pause and do both.

65
00:03:51,012 --> 00:03:55,087
注意，每张图片都在一个隐藏的 Mac 目录里有个双胞胎
Notice that every image comes with a twin in a hidden Mac folder.

66
00:03:55,333 --> 00:03:58,469
快速预测一下：这个 zip 里有 42 个文件
A quick prediction: the zip held 42 files.

67
00:03:58,789 --> 00:04:01,008
Label Studio 应该建多少个 task？
How many tasks should Label Studio make?

68
00:04:05,850 --> 00:04:11,681
21 个。额外数一下：21 张图片，其中一张是 PNG
21. An extra count shows 21 images, one of them a PNG,

69
00:04:11,681 --> 00:04:14,127
另外还有 21 个 Mac 元数据文件
plus 21 Mac metadata files.

70
00:04:14,447 --> 00:04:18,415
只上传图片，不然你会得到 21 个坏掉的 task
Upload only the images, or you get 21 broken tasks.

71
00:04:18,735 --> 00:04:23,301
课上把这叫做数据整理：在垃圾文件变成 task 之前就把它们去掉
The lecture calls this curation, dropping junk before it becomes a task.

72
00:04:23,550 --> 00:04:25,375
再来一个额外检查，为第二部分准备
One more extra, for part 2:

73
00:04:25,375 --> 00:04:29,161
每张照片的指纹，只由它的字节算出来
each photo's fingerprint, computed from its bytes alone.

74
00:04:29,481 --> 00:04:33,833
同样的字节，同样的字符串；改一个字节，它就完全变了
Same bytes, same string; change one byte, and it changes completely.

75
00:04:34,153 --> 00:04:35,753
记住第一个
Remember the first one.

76
00:04:35,950 --> 00:04:38,717
然后用你自己起的名字建 bucket
Then create your bucket with a name of your own,

77
00:04:38,717 --> 00:04:41,369
因为名字是全局唯一的，其他保持默认设置
since names are global, and keep the defaults.

78
00:04:41,689 --> 00:04:45,567
再加两个目录，cheeses unlabeled 和 cheeses labeled
Add two folders, cheeses_unlabeled and cheeses_labeled,

79
00:04:45,567 --> 00:04:48,387
把 21 张图片上传到第一个里
and upload the 21 images into the first.

80
00:04:48,707 --> 00:04:50,307
暂停一下，把它配好
Pause and set it up.

81
00:04:50,371 --> 00:04:54,382
金色标签：存储费用从这里开始，每月不到一美分
A gold tag: storage starts here, a fraction of a cent a month.

82
00:04:55,417 --> 00:04:59,003
README 跑 Label Studio 用的是一个现成的 image
The README runs Label Studio from a ready-made image,

83
00:04:59,003 --> 00:05:00,503
在你自己的 container 里
in your own container,

84
00:05:00,503 --> 00:05:03,758
所以没有任何外部的标注服务能看到你的照片
so no outside labeling service sees your photos.

85
00:05:04,078 --> 00:05:07,193
它的脚本只在网络不存在时才创建网络
Its script creates the network only if it is missing,

86
00:05:07,193 --> 00:05:09,838
还会删掉同名的旧 container
and removes any old container with that name.

87
00:05:10,084 --> 00:05:12,645
然后是一条 docker run，一个参数一个参数地看
Then one docker run, flag by flag.

88
00:05:12,857 --> 00:05:15,261
参数 -d 让它在后台运行
The flag -d runs it in the background,

89
00:05:15,261 --> 00:05:18,361
--network 参数把它放到一条私有的街道上
and the network flag puts it on a private street.

90
00:05:18,681 --> 00:05:24,975
然后，-p 8080:8080 发布这个 port：笔记本墙上的一扇门
Then -p 8080:8080 publishes the port: a door in your laptop wall.

91
00:05:25,295 --> 00:05:29,620
两个 -v 参数挂载一个数据库目录和你的 secrets
Two -v flags mount a database folder and your secrets;

92
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:32,825
-e 这几行设置登录信息和密钥路径
the -e lines set the login and key path.

93
00:05:34,267 --> 00:05:38,662
暂停一下，跑 sh docker-shell.sh；它会拉取 image
Pause and run sh docker-shell.sh; it pulls the image.

94
00:05:38,982 --> 00:05:42,306
然后是 README 的检查，docker container ls
Then the README's check, docker container ls:

95
00:05:42,306 --> 00:05:44,080
状态是 Up，port 8080 已发布
up, port 8080 published.

96
00:05:44,317 --> 00:05:48,946
可是 25 秒后加一个额外的 -a 再看一次：Exited
But look again 25 seconds later, with an extra -a: exited.

97
00:05:49,266 --> 00:05:51,656
来想一个问题：你先看哪儿？
Something to ponder: where do you look first?

98
00:05:58,500 --> 00:06:04,409
看日志。Label Studio 自己说明了原因：它的数据目录不可写
The logs. Label Studio explains itself: its data folder is not writable.

99
00:06:04,729 --> 00:06:06,307
它以用户 1001 运行
It runs as user 1001,

100
00:06:06,307 --> 00:06:09,764
可这个缺失的目录是 Docker 以 root 身份创建的
but Docker created the missing folder as root.

101
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:15,678
修法是一个额外步骤，只针对 Linux
The fix is an extra, for Linux;

102
00:06:15,678 --> 00:06:18,769
Mac 上的 Docker Desktop 一般不会遇到
Docker Desktop for Mac normally avoids this.

103
00:06:19,089 --> 00:06:22,366
用 sudo chown 把目录交给用户 1001
Give the folder to user 1001 with sudo chown,

104
00:06:22,366 --> 00:06:25,425
再跑一次脚本，这次它就一直保持运行了
run the script again, and now it stays up.

105
00:06:25,745 --> 00:06:27,879
在 Linux 上，暂停一下，照样做一遍
On Linux, pause and do the same.

106
00:06:29,084 --> 00:06:34,405
额外检查：日志里有个框，提示有 1.23.2 版本
Extra checks: the logs show a box offering version 1.23.2,

107
00:06:34,405 --> 00:06:40,369
比这个 image 新，这个 image 录制时跑的是 1.23.0
newer than this image, which ran 1.23.0 at the time of recording.

108
00:06:40,689 --> 00:06:43,249
它的 tag 是 latest，所以你的可能不一样
The tag is latest, so yours may differ.

109
00:06:46,150 --> 00:06:48,293
打开 localhost:8080
Open localhost:8080 and log

110
00:06:48,293 --> 00:06:53,851
用你脚本第 19 行和第 20 行里的用户名和密码登录
in with the username and password from lines 19 and 20 of your script.

111
00:06:54,171 --> 00:06:57,820
建一个项目，用 Image Classification 模板
Create a project with the Image Classification template,

112
00:06:57,820 --> 00:07:01,275
选项是 brie、gouda、gruyere 和 parmigiano
with the choices brie, gouda, gruyere and parmigiano.

113
00:07:01,595 --> 00:07:03,039
暂停一下，照着做
Pause and do it.

114
00:07:03,089 --> 00:07:06,998
下方是我们的替身调用，重放了页面发出的请求
Underneath, our stand-in calls replay the page's requests:

115
00:07:06,998 --> 00:07:10,705
我们已经登录，项目 1 里有四种奶酪
we are logged in, and project 1 holds the four cheeses.

116
00:07:13,250 --> 00:07:16,626
回到项目里，打开 Settings，再进 Cloud Storage
Back in the project, open Settings, then Cloud Storage,

117
00:07:16,626 --> 00:07:19,757
添加 source storage，也就是照片的来源
and add source storage, where the photos come from.

118
00:07:20,077 --> 00:07:21,781
用 README 给的值
Use the README's values:

119
00:07:21,781 --> 00:07:24,194
Google Cloud Storage、你的 bucket、前缀
Google Cloud Storage, your bucket,

120
00:07:24,194 --> 00:07:26,252
cheeses unlabeled
the prefix cheeses_unlabeled,

121
00:07:26,252 --> 00:07:27,885
打开 pre-signed URL
and pre-signed URLs on.

122
00:07:28,205 --> 00:07:30,573
要是少了某个复选框，继续就行
If a checkbox is missing, carry on.

123
00:07:30,893 --> 00:07:35,501
凭据留空：意思是用 container 里已经有的那个密钥
Leave the credentials empty: that means the key the container already has.

124
00:07:35,750 --> 00:07:37,414
然后点 Check Connection
Then click Check Connection.

125
00:07:37,734 --> 00:07:39,825
这里失败了：找不到文件
Here it fails: file not found.

126
00:07:40,145 --> 00:07:42,217
额外列一下目录就知道原因
An extra listing shows why:

127
00:07:42,217 --> 00:07:46,053
Label Studio 里面的 /secrets 是空的
/secrets inside Label Studio is empty, on purpose,

128
00:07:46,053 --> 00:07:48,278
这是故意的，等一下就会说到
as you will hear in a moment;

129
00:07:48,278 --> 00:07:49,878
你的应该能通过
yours should pass.

130
00:07:49,979 --> 00:07:52,230
存放 label 的 target storage
The target storage, where labels go,

131
00:07:52,230 --> 00:07:56,358
前缀是 cheeses labeled，也失败了，报错更含糊
with the prefix cheeses_labeled, fails too, with a vaguer message.

132
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,904
关于这次录制，如实说一句
One honest note about this recording.

133
00:07:59,224 --> 00:08:02,688
这台机器没有 Google 账号，没有 bucket
This machine has no Google account, no bucket,

134
00:08:02,688 --> 00:08:05,624
没有浏览器，也没有通往 GitHub 的 SSH 通道
no browser, and no SSH route to GitHub.

135
00:08:05,944 --> 00:08:10,277
目录列表里的密钥是一个明显无效的替身
The key in the folder listings is an obviously invalid stand-in,

136
00:08:10,277 --> 00:08:12,579
每个云端步骤之前都会移走
moved out before every cloud step.

137
00:08:12,899 --> 00:08:17,336
所以这里每一个云端步骤失败的方式，都和密钥放错位置时一模一样
So each cloud step here fails exactly the way a misplaced key fails.

138
00:08:17,656 --> 00:08:20,301
这正是这一讲里最常见的错误
That is the most common mistake in this lecture.

139
00:08:20,621 --> 00:08:24,726
你应该看到的每个成功结果都标着 recorded，并注明出处
Every success you should expect is tagged recorded, with its source,

140
00:08:24,726 --> 00:08:28,408
点击和上传则在本地重放，标着 stand-in
and clicks and uploads are replayed locally, tagged stand-in.

141
00:08:28,650 --> 00:08:32,337
有了真的密钥，两个存储都加上，点 Sync
With a real key, add both storages and click Sync:

142
00:08:32,337 --> 00:08:34,623
一张照片一个 task，你那边是 21 个
one task per photo, 21 for you.

143
00:08:34,943 --> 00:08:38,869
我们的替身导入了 3 个 task，地址也是同一类的
Our stand-in imports 3 tasks with the same kind of addresses.

144
00:08:39,189 --> 00:08:41,050
暂停一下，两个都加上，再点 Sync
Pause, add both, and sync.

145
00:08:41,183 --> 00:08:42,826
那么，谁在碰这些照片？
So who touches the photos?

146
00:08:43,146 --> 00:08:46,457
Label Studio 拿着密钥，列出 bucket 里的东西
Label Studio holds the key and lists the bucket;

147
00:08:46,457 --> 00:08:48,458
你的浏览器请求 task 1
your browser asks for task 1.

148
00:08:48,778 --> 00:08:52,119
来想一个问题：你的浏览器从没见过密钥
Something to ponder: your browser never sees the key,

149
00:08:52,119 --> 00:08:54,325
它怎么能显示一张私有的照片？
so how can it show a private photo?

150
00:09:03,167 --> 00:09:04,738
靠一张签了名的票
With a signed ticket.

151
00:09:04,788 --> 00:09:07,424
Label Studio 不中转照片
Label Studio does not relay the photos;

152
00:09:07,424 --> 00:09:12,831
它用密钥给一个网址签名：只许看一张照片，只在很短的时间里有效
it signs a web address with the key: permission for one photo, for a short time.

153
00:09:13,151 --> 00:09:15,994
你的浏览器拿着这张票直接去找 Google
Your browser carries that ticket straight to Google,

154
00:09:15,994 --> 00:09:17,908
密钥一直留在 container 里
and the key stays in the container.

155
00:09:18,228 --> 00:09:21,983
接着缩略图坏掉了，README 也提醒了你：是 CORS 的问题
Then the thumbnails break, and the README warns you: it is CORS.

156
00:09:25,017 --> 00:09:27,429
页面来自 localhost:8080
The page comes from localhost:8080,

157
00:09:27,429 --> 00:09:31,566
照片来自 Google 的存储地址：这是另一个 origin
the photo from Google's storage address: a different origin.

158
00:09:31,886 --> 00:09:36,064
页面自己的代码去取照片时，像 Label Studio 这样
When the page's own code fetches the photo, as Label Studio does,

159
00:09:36,064 --> 00:09:39,882
你的浏览器把响应交给这段代码，只有一个前提
your browser hands the answer over only if it carries a header

160
00:09:39,882 --> 00:09:41,593
它带着允许这个 origin 的响应头
that allows this origin.

161
00:09:41,913 --> 00:09:46,052
Google 只在 bucket 有自己的 CORS 规则时，才加上这个响应头
Google adds that header only if the bucket has its own CORS rule.

162
00:09:46,300 --> 00:09:50,011
有一个小疏漏：README 把问题归到反向 DNS 查询上
A small slip: the README blames a reverse DNS lookup,

163
00:09:50,011 --> 00:09:52,743
其实原因就是这条同源规则
but the cause is that same-origin rule.

164
00:09:52,984 --> 00:09:55,821
README 用第二个 container 来设置这条规则
The README sets the rule from a second container.

165
00:09:56,141 --> 00:10:00,756
把你的 bucket 名字写到 docker-shell-CLI.sh 的第 23 行
Put your bucket name on line 23 of docker-shell-CLI.sh,

166
00:10:00,756 --> 00:10:02,435
再用 sh 运行它
then run it with sh.

167
00:10:02,755 --> 00:10:05,870
提示符里的 ID 每次运行都会变
The ID in the prompt changes every run,

168
00:10:05,870 --> 00:10:10,584
Apple Silicon 上显示 aarch64，这台机器上显示的是 x86
and Apple Silicon says aarch64 where this machine says x86.

169
00:10:10,904 --> 00:10:12,504
暂停一下，两件都做了
Pause and do both.

170
00:10:14,550 --> 00:10:16,894
这个 container 加入同一条街道
This container joins the same street and calls Label Studio by name, not localhost.

171
00:10:16,894 --> 00:10:20,203
按名字调用 Label Studio，而不是 localhost
This container joins the same street and calls Label Studio by name, not localhost.

172
00:10:20,523 --> 00:10:23,937
它按目录名挂载这个 repo，所以别改这个名字
It mounts the repo by its folder name, so keep that name.

173
00:10:24,184 --> 00:10:27,967
在里面先跑 python cli.py -c，再跑 -m
Inside, run python cli.py -c, then -m;

174
00:10:27,967 --> 00:10:29,859
暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
pause and run them.

175
00:10:30,179 --> 00:10:35,917
这里两条都卡在存储客户端：找不到文件，因为 ADC 在找密钥
Here both stop at the storage client: file not found, because ADC looks for the key.

176
00:10:36,237 --> 00:10:40,807
代码构造一条规则：任意 origin、只允许 GET、max age 一小时
The code builds one rule, any origin, GET only, max age one hour,

177
00:10:40,807 --> 00:10:42,424
然后 patch 到 bucket 上
and patches the bucket.

178
00:10:42,667 --> 00:10:47,488
有了真的密钥，-c 会打印这条规则，-m 会打印 bucket 的设置
With a real key, -c prints the rule, and -m prints the bucket settings.

179
00:10:47,808 --> 00:10:50,582
这下响应头来了，缩略图也加载出来了
Now the header arrives and the thumbnails load.

180
00:10:50,902 --> 00:10:53,623
这个 max age 只缓存预检请求
The max age only caches preflight checks,

181
00:10:53,623 --> 00:10:56,278
而普通的图片请求从来不发预检请求
which a plain image request never makes.

182
00:10:56,517 --> 00:10:58,117
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

183
00:10:58,181 --> 00:11:02,149
你跑了 -c 也刷新了，缩略图还是坏的
You ran -c and refreshed, and the thumbnails are still broken.

184
00:11:02,469 --> 00:11:04,069
说出两个嫌疑点
Name two suspects.

185
00:11:12,717 --> 00:11:14,680
第一个：规则没加到你的 bucket 上
One: the rule missed your bucket.

186
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:19,300
要么 -c 失败了，要么第 23 行写的是你的另一个 bucket
-c failed, or line 23 names another bucket of yours;

187
00:11:19,300 --> 00:11:21,698
-m 会显示哪个 bucket 拿到了规则
-m shows which bucket got it.

188
00:11:22,018 --> 00:11:25,560
第二个：你的浏览器用了缓存的响应；强制刷新一下
Two: your browser reused cached answers; hard refresh.

189
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:27,881
而 curl 从来没遇到过保安
And curl never met a bouncer:

190
00:11:27,881 --> 00:11:30,850
CORS 是浏览器的规则，不是访问控制
CORS is a browser rule, not access control.

191
00:11:31,900 --> 00:11:33,296
回到 Label Studio
Back in Label Studio,

192
00:11:33,296 --> 00:11:36,419
点开一个 task，选一种奶酪，然后点 Submit
click a task, pick a cheese, and submit; repeat

193
00:11:36,419 --> 00:11:38,897
重复几次。暂停一下，标注几张
for a few. Pause and label some.

194
00:11:39,217 --> 00:11:42,851
一次点击会变成什么，用替身调用来看
Here is what one click becomes, as a stand-in call:

195
00:11:42,851 --> 00:11:46,769
一个小小的 JSON 文档，result 里写着 choices 是 gouda
a small JSON document whose result says choices, gouda.

196
00:11:47,017 --> 00:11:49,513
Label Studio 把它存进自己的数据库
Label Studio saves it in its database,

197
00:11:49,513 --> 00:11:53,191
target storage 再往 cheeses labeled 里写一份副本
and the target storage writes a copy to cheeses_labeled,

198
00:11:53,191 --> 00:11:56,212
指回那张从没移动过的照片
pointing back at the photo, which never moved.

199
00:11:56,532 --> 00:11:59,047
课件把照片按行分了类，但在磁盘上
The slide sorts photos into rows,

200
00:11:59,047 --> 00:12:02,172
一条 label 就是一张 JSON 小纸条
but on disk a label is a small JSON note,

201
00:12:02,172 --> 00:12:05,449
标注好的数据集就是照片加上小纸条
and a labeled dataset is photos plus notes.

202
00:12:05,769 --> 00:12:10,121
在控制台里，这个目录里每条标注对应一个 JSON 文件
In the console, that folder shows one JSON file per annotation.

203
00:12:10,441 --> 00:12:12,126
打开一个就能看到这张小纸条
Open one to see the note.

204
00:12:14,567 --> 00:12:17,895
命令行 container 按名字调用 Label Studio
The command line container calls Label Studio by name.

205
00:12:18,215 --> 00:12:22,289
来想一个问题：要是它的地址写成 localhost:8080 呢？
Something to ponder: what if its address were localhost:8080?

206
00:12:29,133 --> 00:12:31,652
连不上：在 container 里面
It cannot connect: inside a container,

207
00:12:31,652 --> 00:12:35,298
localhost 指的就是这个 container，那里什么都没在监听
localhost is that container, and nothing listens there.

208
00:12:35,618 --> 00:12:37,982
名字能用，是因为 Docker 网络维护着
The name works, because the Docker network

209
00:12:37,982 --> 00:12:40,120
一本 container 名字的电话簿
keeps a phone book of container names.

210
00:12:40,367 --> 00:12:42,457
要从代码里列出 label
To list labels from code,

211
00:12:42,457 --> 00:12:46,387
先从 Account & Settings 复制你的访问令牌
copy your access token from Account & Settings,

212
00:12:46,387 --> 00:12:51,738
再跑 README 的命令：python cli.py -p -k，后面跟你的令牌
then run the README command: python cli.py -p -k and your token.

213
00:12:52,058 --> 00:12:53,522
暂停一下，试一试
Pause and try it.

214
00:12:53,572 --> 00:12:57,620
在 Label Studio 1.23.0 上它会报 401
On Label Studio 1.23.0 it fails with a 401;

215
00:12:57,620 --> 00:13:04,964
我们这边的报错说，这个组织已经停用了 legacy token 身份验证
ours says legacy token authentication has been disabled for this organization.

216
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:09,232
额外检查一下就知道原因：这个版本有两种令牌
An extra check shows why: this version has two kinds of token.

217
00:13:09,552 --> 00:13:13,313
页面默认显示较新的 personal token
The page shows a newer personal token by default,

218
00:13:13,313 --> 00:13:18,149
legacy 那种是关掉的，而 cli.py 只认 legacy
the legacy kind is switched off, and cli.py speaks only legacy.

219
00:13:19,883 --> 00:13:23,706
修法：在 Organization 的 API Tokens Settings
The fix: in Organization, API Tokens Settings,

220
00:13:23,706 --> 00:13:25,451
里启用 legacy token
enable legacy tokens.

221
00:13:25,771 --> 00:13:29,056
然后复制 legacy token，不是 personal token
Then copy the legacy token, not the personal one.

222
00:13:29,376 --> 00:13:30,976
暂停一下，两件都做了
Pause and do both.

223
00:13:32,900 --> 00:13:36,783
再跑一次 -p，它列出了项目 1：Cheese labels
Run -p again, and it lists project 1, Cheese labels.

224
00:13:37,103 --> 00:13:39,033
然后带上你的令牌跑 -t
Then -t with your token:

225
00:13:39,033 --> 00:13:41,927
我们的替身里是 3 个 task，你那边是 21 个
3 tasks in our stand-in, 21 for you;

226
00:13:41,927 --> 00:13:44,420
我们的有一张标注成了 gouda
ours has one labeled, as gouda.

227
00:13:44,740 --> 00:13:46,311
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

228
00:13:46,361 --> 00:13:49,967
README 的示例写的是 amanita；格式是一样的
The README's sample says amanita; the format is the same.

229
00:13:57,800 --> 00:14:00,893
README 的 Extra 一节把两个 container 一起跑起来
The README's extra section runs both containers

230
00:14:00,893 --> 00:14:02,493
用的是一个 compose 文件
from one compose file.

231
00:14:02,707 --> 00:14:05,815
用 exit 退出命令行 container
Leave the command line container with exit,

232
00:14:05,815 --> 00:14:08,922
停掉 Label Studio，再用 docker ps 检查
stop Label Studio, and check with docker ps;

233
00:14:08,922 --> 00:14:10,422
暂停一下，照着做
pause and do it.

234
00:14:10,472 --> 00:14:15,720
先把你的 bucket 名字也填到 docker-compose.yml 的第 17 行
First put your bucket name on line 17 of docker-compose.yml as well.

235
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:18,906
然后跑 sh docker-shell-compose.sh
Then run sh docker-shell-compose.sh;

236
00:14:18,906 --> 00:14:24,637
如果找不到这个命令，就用卡片上的 docker compose 写法
if docker-compose is not found, use the docker compose form on the card.

237
00:14:24,957 --> 00:14:27,098
这里它因为名字冲突停下了
Here it stops on a name conflict:

238
00:14:27,098 --> 00:14:31,251
docker stop 会把 container 留在那儿，名字还被它占着
docker stop leaves the container behind, still holding its name.

239
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:33,872
额外跑一下 docker rm 把名字腾出来
An extra docker rm frees the name;

240
00:14:33,872 --> 00:14:37,431
暂停一下，删掉它，再跑一次 compose 脚本
pause, remove it, and run the compose script again.

241
00:14:37,751 --> 00:14:40,279
这次 Compose 创建了 Label Studio
This time Compose creates Label Studio

242
00:14:40,279 --> 00:14:42,807
外加一个一次性的命令行 container
plus a one-off command line container.

243
00:14:44,317 --> 00:14:47,993
额外用 echo 打印出来的，是 README 里的 bucket 名字
An extra echo prints the README's bucket name:

244
00:14:47,993 --> 00:14:50,150
compose 自己存了一份
compose keeps its own copy,

245
00:14:50,150 --> 00:14:54,066
在 docker-compose.yml 的第 17 行，所以这里也要改
on line 17 of docker-compose.yml, so edit it too.

246
00:14:54,300 --> 00:14:56,237
而第一次调用被拒绝了
And the first call is refused:

247
00:14:56,237 --> 00:14:59,400
depends on 这个设置会先启动 Label Studio
the depends_on setting starts Label Studio first,

248
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,660
但不会等到它开始监听
but does not wait until it listens.

249
00:15:01,980 --> 00:15:03,641
额外加一个等待循环之后
After an extra wait loop,

250
00:15:03,641 --> 00:15:07,228
项目 1 回来了，因为挂载的是同一个目录
project 1 is back, because the same folder is mounted.

251
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:14,232
Label Studio 一直在跑，你退出命令行 container 之后也一样
Label Studio keeps running after you exit the command line container.

252
00:15:14,552 --> 00:15:18,471
然后是 README 的清理：列出、停止、prune，再列出 image
Then the README's cleanup: list, stop, prune, and list the images;

253
00:15:18,471 --> 00:15:20,071
暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
pause and run them.

254
00:15:20,291 --> 00:15:25,837
这次 prune 把网络也删了，所以下次要先跑 docker-shell.sh
The prune also removed the network, so next time run docker-shell.sh first.

255
00:15:29,250 --> 00:15:32,364
来想一个问题：跑完 docker system prune
Something to ponder: after docker system prune,

256
00:15:32,364 --> 00:15:34,285
你标注好的项目没了吗？
is your labeled project gone?

257
00:15:41,133 --> 00:15:47,512
没有。数据库文件还在挂载的目录里，prune 从不碰你挂载的目录
No. The database file is still in the mounted folder, and prune never touches folders you mount.

258
00:15:47,832 --> 00:15:52,440
可它们指向的照片可能被悄悄换掉：同样的名字，新的图片
But the photos they point at can change under them: same name, new picture.

259
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:56,093
那么，一个模型看过的到底是哪些照片，怎么把它准确地冻结下来？
So how do you freeze exactly which photos a model saw?

260
00:15:56,280 --> 00:15:57,880
这就是第二部分
That is part 2.

261
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:01,267
第二部分：把模型看到的照片冻结下来
Part 2: freezing which photos a model saw.

262
00:16:01,587 --> 00:16:05,192
只用 git 的话，每个照片版本都会被复制进每一个 clone
Git alone would copy every photo version into every clone.

263
00:16:05,512 --> 00:16:09,568
课上的四种做法里，我们搭的是基于文件的做法
Of the lecture's four approaches, we build the file-based one:

264
00:16:09,568 --> 00:16:14,344
git 给一个记着指纹的小文件做版本管理，bucket 存照片
git versions a small file of fingerprints, and a bucket holds the photos.

265
00:16:14,664 --> 00:16:16,264
用的工具是 DVC
The tool is DVC.

266
00:16:18,467 --> 00:16:20,172
先退到上一级目录
First, move up one folder,

267
00:16:20,172 --> 00:16:23,779
让新的 clone 和 data-labeling、secrets 放在一起
so the new clone sits beside data-labeling and secrets.

268
00:16:24,099 --> 00:16:28,174
这份 data-versioning 的 README 一开头也是那三条清理命令
The data-versioning README starts with the same three cleanup commands.

269
00:16:28,494 --> 00:16:30,094
暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
Pause and run them.

270
00:16:34,100 --> 00:16:36,681
然后 clone README 指定的 starter 分支
Then clone the starter branch the README names.

271
00:16:37,001 --> 00:16:40,232
它的 SSH 命令需要你在 GitHub 上配好 SSH 密钥
Its SSH command needs your key on GitHub,

272
00:16:40,232 --> 00:16:42,911
而这台机器没有 SSH 通道
and this machine has no SSH route.

273
00:16:43,231 --> 00:16:47,689
所以同一个分支改走 HTTPS，README 也允许这样做
So the same branch comes over HTTPS, which the README allows.

274
00:16:48,009 --> 00:16:49,737
暂停一下，clone 下来，再进去
Pause, clone it, and move in.

275
00:16:53,350 --> 00:16:58,705
有一点要说明：上课那天 README 改了，现在它让你 clone main
One note: on the day of the lecture the README changed, and it now says to clone main.

276
00:16:59,025 --> 00:17:03,155
这个分支会把授课老师做好的 DVC 文件一起带过来
That branch brings the instructor's finished DVC files along,

277
00:17:03,155 --> 00:17:05,254
额外再 clone 一份就能看到
as an extra second clone shows.

278
00:17:05,574 --> 00:17:08,555
这个视频跟的是课程 pin 住的那版 README
This video follows the course's pinned README:

279
00:17:08,555 --> 00:17:10,694
starter 分支，外加一处修复
the starter branch, plus one fix.

280
00:17:10,933 --> 00:17:15,720
删掉旧的 git 历史，这样代码就不再和课程的 repo 绑在一起
Remove the old git history, so the code is no longer tied to the class repo,

281
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,610
再用 git init 重新开始
and start fresh with git init.

282
00:17:17,930 --> 00:17:19,502
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

283
00:17:19,552 --> 00:17:23,925
Git 的提示里提到了 master，所以下一步要给分支改名
Git's hint mentions master, which is why the branch gets renamed next.

284
00:17:25,933 --> 00:17:30,447
在 GitHub 上建一个空的私有 repo，叫 data-versioning
On GitHub, create an empty private repo called data-versioning,

285
00:17:30,447 --> 00:17:33,528
不要 README、许可证，也不要 .gitignore 文件
with no README, license or .gitignore file.

286
00:17:33,848 --> 00:17:35,380
然后是五条命令
Then the five commands:

287
00:17:35,380 --> 00:17:39,778
改分支名、把你的 repo 加为 origin、add、commit、push
rename the branch, add your repo as origin, add, commit, and push.

288
00:17:40,098 --> 00:17:41,627
暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
Pause and run them.

289
00:17:41,677 --> 00:17:44,664
你的 repo 现在在 main 上显示 7 个文件
Your repo now shows the 7 files on main.

290
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:50,152
一个 bucket 只存有名字的对象，别的什么都不存
A bucket stores named objects, nothing else.

291
00:17:50,472 --> 00:17:54,248
再加上版本管理之类的工具，课上就把它叫做数据湖
Add tools, like versioning, and the lecture calls it a data lake.

292
00:17:54,568 --> 00:17:58,387
它的目录只是共同的名字前缀，这就埋下了一个陷阱
Its folders are only shared name prefixes, which sets a trap.

293
00:17:59,267 --> 00:18:03,390
第一部分的 secrets 目录已经在这个 repo 旁边了
The secrets folder from part 1 already sits beside this repo,

294
00:18:03,390 --> 00:18:05,283
额外用 tree 看一下就能看到
as an extra tree view shows.

295
00:18:05,603 --> 00:18:09,656
README 要的是同一个服务账号和密钥，所以两个都直接复用
The README wants the same service account and key, so reuse both.

296
00:18:12,883 --> 00:18:17,896
在你的 bucket 里，用控制台建两个目录：DVC store 和 images
In your bucket, create two folders in the console: dvc_store and images.

297
00:18:18,216 --> 00:18:19,315
有一个小疏漏
A small gap:

298
00:18:19,315 --> 00:18:24,040
课程的 README 从没说要把第一批照片放进 images 目录
the course's README never says to put the first photos into the images folder,

299
00:18:24,040 --> 00:18:25,982
后面却说再加一些
yet later it says to add more.

300
00:18:26,302 --> 00:18:29,374
所以把 zip 里的 Image 1 到 Image 4 上传上去
So upload Image_1 through Image_4 from the zip.

301
00:18:29,694 --> 00:18:31,294
暂停一下，照着做
Pause and do it.

302
00:18:33,500 --> 00:18:35,000
在 docker-shell.sh 里
In docker-shell.sh,

303
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:38,492
把 bucket、项目和可用区换成你自己的
replace the bucket, project and zone with yours.

304
00:18:38,812 --> 00:18:40,924
真正用到的只有 bucket 名字
Only the bucket name is ever used.

305
00:18:41,244 --> 00:18:42,700
暂停一下，改好它
Pause and edit it.

306
00:18:42,750 --> 00:18:46,270
这个 entrypoint 会跑课上画的四个阶段
The entrypoint runs the four stages the lecture draws.

307
00:18:46,590 --> 00:18:48,190
用密钥做身份验证
Authenticate with the key.

308
00:18:48,489 --> 00:18:51,795
把整个 bucket 挂载成一个目录，用的是 gcsfuse
Mount the whole bucket as a folder, with gcsfuse.

309
00:18:52,115 --> 00:18:56,467
把它的 images 目录绑定到应用要的路径上：cheese dataset
Bind its images folder to the path the app expects, cheese_dataset.

310
00:18:56,787 --> 00:19:00,998
然后使用数据：DVC 把这个目录当本地目录用
Then use the data: DVC works on that folder as if it were local,

311
00:19:00,998 --> 00:19:03,827
而每个文件其实都是从 bucket 取来的
while each file is fetched from the bucket.

312
00:19:04,217 --> 00:19:09,209
课上把挂载那一行拆开讲：工具、密钥文件、bucket、挂载点
The lecture takes the mount line apart: tool, key file, bucket, mount point.

313
00:19:09,529 --> 00:19:12,486
有一个参数没传，--implicit-dirs
One flag is not passed, --implicit-dirs,

314
00:19:12,486 --> 00:19:18,105
所以 gcsfuse 只显示控制台建的目录，它们会留下一个标记对象
so gcsfuse only shows folders the console made, which leave a marker object.

315
00:19:18,425 --> 00:19:19,750
这就是那个陷阱
That was the trap.

316
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:21,523
注意这两个 bind mount
Note the two bind mounts:

317
00:19:21,523 --> 00:19:24,625
-v 把你笔记本上的 repo 接到 container 里
-v joins your laptop's repo to the container,

318
00:19:24,625 --> 00:19:28,141
里面那个则把 bucket 的 images 目录接进来
and the inner one joins the bucket's images folder.

319
00:19:28,383 --> 00:19:31,455
挂载需要 fuse 设备和挂载权限
Mounting needs the fuse device and mount rights,

320
00:19:31,455 --> 00:19:34,847
所以要加 --privileged 参数和多加的那个 capability
hence the --privileged flag and the extra capability.

321
00:19:35,167 --> 00:19:38,708
脚本还会挂载你的 repo、secrets 和 git 配置
The script also mounts your repo, secrets and git config.

322
00:19:39,028 --> 00:19:41,010
先把 git 配好，再做第一次运行
Set up git before the first run,

323
00:19:41,010 --> 00:19:43,487
不然 Docker 会在那个位置建一个目录
or Docker creates a folder in its place.

324
00:19:44,533 --> 00:19:47,968
你已经在 data-versioning 目录里了
You are already in the data-versioning folder,

325
00:19:47,968 --> 00:19:49,909
所以跑：sh docker-shell.sh
so run sh docker-shell.sh.

326
00:19:50,229 --> 00:19:51,651
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

327
00:19:51,701 --> 00:19:54,439
在 starter 分支上，构建直接挂了
On the starter branch, the build dies:

328
00:19:54,439 --> 00:19:58,400
包 google-cloud-sdk 没有可安装的候选版本
package google-cloud-sdk has no installation candidate.

329
00:19:58,720 --> 00:20:02,730
报错里甚至点出了替代品：google-cloud-cli
The message even names the replacement, google-cloud-cli.

330
00:20:02,966 --> 00:20:07,056
有一个小疏漏，不是你的错：Google 给这个包改了名
A small slip, and not your fault: Google renamed the package,

331
00:20:07,056 --> 00:20:11,414
main 分支修了第 36 行，starter 却一直没修
the main branch fixed line 36, and the starter never got the fix.

332
00:20:11,734 --> 00:20:14,486
你也照样改这一个词，这是额外步骤
Make the same one-word change, as an extra.

333
00:20:14,806 --> 00:20:16,406
暂停一下，改好它
Pause and edit it.

334
00:20:17,283 --> 00:20:18,883
暂停一下，再跑一遍
Pause and run it again.

335
00:20:19,075 --> 00:20:20,675
第一次构建比较慢
The first build is slow.

336
00:20:20,952 --> 00:20:22,510
然后 entrypoint 开始跑
Then the entrypoint runs,

337
00:20:22,510 --> 00:20:25,624
每个阶段失败的方式都和缺了密钥时一样
and every stage fails the way a missing key fails.

338
00:20:25,944 --> 00:20:28,813
gcloud 工具找不到密钥文件
The gcloud tool cannot find the key file,

339
00:20:28,813 --> 00:20:32,451
gcsfuse 也找不到，所以 bucket 根本没挂载上
and neither can gcsfuse, so the bucket never mounts.

340
00:20:32,771 --> 00:20:34,867
可下一行却写着 bucket 已挂载
Yet the next line says bucket mounted,

341
00:20:34,867 --> 00:20:37,294
因为脚本不管怎样都会打印这一行
because the script prints it no matter what.

342
00:20:37,614 --> 00:20:41,368
接着 bind mount 失败了：特殊设备不存在
Then the bind mount fails: special device does not exist.

343
00:20:41,616 --> 00:20:43,526
可你还是拿到了一个 root 提示符
And still you get a root prompt,

344
00:20:43,526 --> 00:20:46,331
因为 entrypoint 遇到错误不会停
because the entrypoint does not stop at errors.

345
00:20:46,651 --> 00:20:51,263
额外检查：cheese dataset 目录是空的
Extra checks: the cheese_dataset folder is empty,

346
00:20:51,263 --> 00:20:56,251
装的是 DVC 3.63.0，由 lock 文件 pin 住
and DVC 3.63.0 is installed, pinned by the lock file.

347
00:20:56,571 --> 00:20:59,984
所以今天的规则是：先列一下目录，再 add 它
So the rule for today: list the folder before you add it.

348
00:21:00,233 --> 00:21:03,902
有了真的密钥，里面的目录会列出你的四张照片
With a real key, the folder inside lists your four photos.

349
00:21:04,222 --> 00:21:08,190
来想一个问题：在你的笔记本上，同一个目录是空的
Something to ponder: on your laptop, the same folder is empty.

350
00:21:08,510 --> 00:21:10,110
挂载坏了吗？
Is the mount broken?

351
00:21:18,766 --> 00:21:23,922
没有。两个挂载都只存在于 container 里面。你的笔记本看到的
No. Both mounts exist only inside the container. Your laptop

352
00:21:23,922 --> 00:21:28,105
是 entrypoint 通过 repo 的挂载建出来的空目录
sees the empty folder the entrypoint made through the repo mount;

353
00:21:28,105 --> 00:21:30,841
额外列一下就能看到，它属于 root
an extra listing shows it, owned by root.

354
00:21:34,400 --> 00:21:37,323
在 container 里面跑：dvc init
Inside the container, run dvc init.

355
00:21:37,643 --> 00:21:42,720
在 Linux 上它可能会停下：仓库路径不属于当前用户
On Linux it may stop: the repository path is not owned by the current user.

356
00:21:43,040 --> 00:21:46,215
你在里面是 root，而 repo 在磁盘上属于你
You are root inside, the repo is yours on disk,

357
00:21:46,215 --> 00:21:49,120
所以 git 拒绝了，留下一个半成品目录
so git refuses, leaving a half-made folder.

358
00:21:49,367 --> 00:21:51,440
修法是一个额外步骤，只针对 Linux
The fix is an extra, for Linux:

359
00:21:51,440 --> 00:21:54,316
在你的笔记本上删掉那些半成品文件
on your laptop, remove the half-made files.

360
00:21:54,636 --> 00:21:58,348
然后把 /app 标成安全目录，写进你的 git 配置
Then mark /app as a safe directory in your git config.

361
00:21:58,668 --> 00:22:01,890
再启动一次 container，dvc init 就成功了
Start the container again, and dvc init works.

362
00:22:02,210 --> 00:22:03,810
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

363
00:22:04,583 --> 00:22:06,925
如果你 clone 的是 main，就会停在这里
If you cloned main, it stops here:

364
00:22:06,925 --> 00:22:12,988
DVC 已经配置好了，remote 被拒绝，配置还指向课程的 bucket
DVC is already set up, the remote is refused, and the config points at the class bucket.

365
00:22:13,308 --> 00:22:14,883
从 starter 开始
Start from the starter.

366
00:22:14,933 --> 00:22:18,950
然后把 DVC 指向你 bucket 里的 DVC store 目录
Then point DVC at the dvc_store folder in your bucket,

367
00:22:18,950 --> 00:22:20,586
作为它的默认 remote
as its default remote.

368
00:22:20,906 --> 00:22:22,506
暂停一下，加上它
Pause and add it.

369
00:22:24,900 --> 00:22:27,716
来看 dvc add 会对照片做什么
Here is what dvc add will do with photos.

370
00:22:28,036 --> 00:22:30,681
它用 MD5 给每张照片算指纹
It fingerprints each photo with MD5.

371
00:22:31,001 --> 00:22:34,189
它把一份副本按这个指纹放进缓存
It files a copy in its cache under that fingerprint,

372
00:22:34,189 --> 00:22:36,825
放在用指纹前 2 个字符命名的架子上
on a shelf named by the first 2 characters.

373
00:22:37,145 --> 00:22:41,118
然后它给一个 manifest 算指纹，也就是指纹和文件名的列表
Then it fingerprints a manifest, the list of fingerprints and names,

374
00:22:41,118 --> 00:22:46,319
再把这个指纹写进指针文件，在 git 里由它代替这个目录
and writes that fingerprint into the pointer file, which stands in for the folder in git.

375
00:22:48,233 --> 00:22:52,238
第二个陷阱：挂载失败了，所以目录是空的
A second trap: the mount failed, so the folder is empty,

376
00:22:52,238 --> 00:22:55,956
而 dvc add 照样高高兴兴地做出一个 0 个文件的版本
and dvc add happily makes a version with zero files.

377
00:22:56,717 --> 00:23:01,622
没有挂载 bucket，我们的替身就把四张照片复制进笔记本上的目录
With no bucket mounted, our stand-in copies four photos into the laptop folder,

378
00:23:01,622 --> 00:23:05,720
container 通过 repo 的挂载能看到它们，我们再 add 一次
which the container sees through the repo mount, and we add again.

379
00:23:06,040 --> 00:23:10,498
现在指针文件写着 4 个文件，整个目录一个指纹
Now the pointer file says 4 files and one fingerprint for the folder.

380
00:23:10,818 --> 00:23:12,418
暂停一下，add 你自己的
Pause and add yours.

381
00:23:16,250 --> 00:23:19,962
缓存里能看到这些架子，还有之前那个空版本
The cache shows those shelves, plus the empty version from before.

382
00:23:24,667 --> 00:23:29,851
所以一行字能锁定 600 KB：它给指纹的列表算指纹
So one line pins 600 kilobytes: it fingerprints the list of fingerprints.

383
00:23:30,171 --> 00:23:34,195
而授课老师在课程 repo 里打的 tag
And the instructor's tag in the class repo holds the same fingerprint,

384
00:23:34,195 --> 00:23:35,973
存的是同一个指纹，一个字符都不差
character for character.

385
00:23:37,317 --> 00:23:38,917
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

386
00:23:38,981 --> 00:23:42,181
你把 Image 2 改名叫 brie 2，再 add 一次
You give Image_2 the new name brie_2, and add again.

387
00:23:42,501 --> 00:23:48,325
哪个会变：是照片的指纹，manifest 的指纹，大小，还是文件数？
Which changes: the photo fingerprint, the manifest fingerprint, the size, or the file count?

388
00:23:57,167 --> 00:24:01,028
只有 manifest 的指纹变了，因为列表里有一个名字变了
Only the manifest fingerprint, because one name in the list changed.

389
00:24:01,348 --> 00:24:05,572
开头那两个目录正好反过来：名字一样，字节是新的
The opening's two folders were the reverse: same names, new bytes.

390
00:24:05,892 --> 00:24:09,210
而且 DVC 存的是整个文件，不是差异
And DVC stores whole files, not differences;

391
00:24:09,210 --> 00:24:13,508
改一个像素，就是一个新指纹、一份新副本
one changed pixel means a new fingerprint and a new copy.

392
00:24:15,150 --> 00:24:16,814
接下来是 dvc push
Next, dvc push.

393
00:24:17,134 --> 00:24:18,556
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

394
00:24:18,606 --> 00:24:20,633
这里没有凭据，失败了
Here it fails without credentials.

395
00:24:20,953 --> 00:24:22,954
为了展示 push 会上传什么
To show what a push uploads,

396
00:24:22,954 --> 00:24:26,241
额外 push 到一个本地的替身 remote
an extra push goes to a local stand-in remote:

397
00:24:26,241 --> 00:24:29,742
推送了 5 个文件，四张照片加上 manifest
5 files pushed, the four photos and the manifest.

398
00:24:29,983 --> 00:24:33,311
在你的 bucket 里，DVC store 现在和缓存一模一样
In your bucket, the dvc_store now mirrors the cache.

399
00:24:33,631 --> 00:24:38,559
金色标签：照片的第二份副本，仍然每月不到一美分
A gold tag: a second copy of the photos, still a fraction of a cent a month.

400
00:24:38,879 --> 00:24:43,848
所以现在这些字节在三个地方：你上传到的 images 目录
So the bytes now sit in three places: the images folder you upload to,

401
00:24:43,848 --> 00:24:47,114
还有你磁盘上由 dvc add 填满的缓存
and the cache on your disk, filled by dvc add.

402
00:24:47,434 --> 00:24:52,276
第三个是 DVC store，那里每个文件都用它的指纹命名
The third is the dvc_store, where every file is named by its fingerprint.

403
00:24:52,596 --> 00:24:54,558
这个 images 目录可以变
The images folder can change;

404
00:24:54,558 --> 00:24:58,954
DVC store 从不覆盖，因为新的字节会有新的名字
the dvc_store never overwrites, because new bytes get a new name.

405
00:24:59,200 --> 00:25:01,333
现在在 container 外面用 git
Now git, outside the container.

406
00:25:01,653 --> 00:25:06,588
这里 git status 显示 dvc init 已经暂存好的 DVC 文件
Here, git status shows the DVC files that dvc init already staged,

407
00:25:06,588 --> 00:25:09,653
新的指针文件，还有你的两处改动
the new pointer file, and your two edits.

408
00:25:09,973 --> 00:25:13,577
接着 add 再 commit：6 个小文本文件
Add and commit: 6 small text files and no photos,

409
00:25:13,577 --> 00:25:17,696
没有照片，因为 .gitignore 文件把数据集目录排除了
because the .gitignore file excludes the dataset folder.

410
00:25:17,933 --> 00:25:21,509
给这个 commit 打上 dataset v20 这个 tag
Tag the commit as dataset_v20, a permanent name,

411
00:25:21,509 --> 00:25:24,563
一个永久的名字，再把分支和 tag 一起 push
and push the branch and the tag together;

412
00:25:24,563 --> 00:25:27,320
atomic 的意思是两个都到，或者都不到
atomic means both arrive, or neither.

413
00:25:27,640 --> 00:25:29,168
暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
Pause and run them.

414
00:25:29,218 --> 00:25:32,909
额外看一下 log，能看到这个 tag，它锁定了这六行
An extra log shows the tag, which pins these six lines.

415
00:25:35,033 --> 00:25:37,905
额外和授课老师的 tag 做一次 diff
An extra diff against the instructor's tag:

416
00:25:37,905 --> 00:25:41,646
完全一样，同样的字节，同样的指纹，在任何机器上都一样
identical, same bytes, same fingerprint, on any machine.

417
00:25:41,966 --> 00:25:46,318
整个诀窍就在这儿：git 保存的是指纹列表的指纹
That is the whole trick: git keeps the fingerprint of a list of fingerprints.

418
00:25:46,638 --> 00:25:49,732
一根绳子从 tag 一直通到你 bucket 里的字节
A rope leads from the tag to the bytes in your bucket.

419
00:25:49,967 --> 00:25:52,908
README 提醒说这个 tag 可能已经被占用
The README warns that this tag may be taken;

420
00:25:52,908 --> 00:25:56,986
这只适用于 fork，你的新 repo 一个 tag 都没有
that applies only to a fork, and your fresh repo has no tags.

421
00:25:57,306 --> 00:26:01,801
它的表格总结得很清楚：git 管代码和小小的 DVC 文件
Its table sums it up: git holds code and small DVC files,

422
00:26:01,801 --> 00:26:06,138
DVC 跟踪数据集，bucket 存各个版本
DVC tracks the dataset, the bucket stores the versions.

423
00:26:06,458 --> 00:26:09,603
README 接下来要在 Colab 里查看第 20 版
The README now opens Colab for version 20;

424
00:26:09,603 --> 00:26:13,796
我们等第 21 版做完，再一次看两个版本
we'll do that once, for both versions, after version 21.

425
00:26:16,033 --> 00:26:17,633
现在做第二个版本
Now a second version.

426
00:26:17,825 --> 00:26:21,057
上传几张新照片到 images 目录
Upload a few more photos to the images folder;

427
00:26:21,057 --> 00:26:23,585
我们的替身复制进去一张：Image 5
our stand-in copies in one, Image_5.

428
00:26:23,905 --> 00:26:27,664
用真的 bucket 时，挂载可能要过一会儿才能发现新文件
With a real bucket, the mount can take a little while to notice,

429
00:26:27,664 --> 00:26:29,264
所以先列一下再 add
so list before you add.

430
00:26:29,345 --> 00:26:31,222
暂停一下，上传一两张
Pause and upload one or two.

431
00:26:31,466 --> 00:26:33,066
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

432
00:26:33,130 --> 00:26:37,141
四张照片已经在 DVC store 里了，你再加一张
Four photos are already in the dvc_store, and you add one.

433
00:26:37,461 --> 00:26:40,213
这时 dvc push 会上传多少个对象？
How many objects will dvc push upload?

434
00:26:49,050 --> 00:26:51,461
两个：新照片和一个新的 manifest
Two: the new photo and a new manifest.

435
00:26:51,781 --> 00:26:54,675
再启动 container，列一下目录，然后 add
Start the container again, list the folder, and add it;

436
00:26:54,675 --> 00:26:56,275
暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
pause and run them.

437
00:26:56,495 --> 00:26:59,738
结果是 5 个文件，还有一个新的 manifest 指纹
It gives 5 files and a new manifest fingerprint.

438
00:27:00,058 --> 00:27:05,476
课程的 v21 版本指纹不一样，因为它的第五张照片是另一张图
The class version 21 has a different one, because its fifth photo was another image.

439
00:27:09,216 --> 00:27:11,840
然后是 dvc push；暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Then dvc push; pause and run it.

440
00:27:12,160 --> 00:27:14,982
这里本地替身显示推送了 2 个文件
Here the local stand-in shows 2 files pushed,

441
00:27:14,982 --> 00:27:18,304
因为四张旧照片已经在架子上了
because the four old photos are already on the shelf.

442
00:27:18,624 --> 00:27:21,248
这就是课上承诺的省下来的空间
That is the saved space the lecture promised.

443
00:27:21,483 --> 00:27:25,288
回到你的笔记本上，再来那五条 git 命令
Back on your laptop, the five git commands again:

444
00:27:25,288 --> 00:27:27,928
status 只显示指针文件改了
status shows only the pointer file

445
00:27:27,928 --> 00:27:32,043
然后 add、commit、打 dataset v21 这个 tag，再 push
changed; then add, commit, tag dataset_v21, and push.

446
00:27:32,363 --> 00:27:33,892
暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
Pause and run them.

447
00:27:33,942 --> 00:27:37,099
额外做一次 diff，整个改动只有三行
An extra diff shows the whole change in three lines.

448
00:27:43,366 --> 00:27:46,412
这个 starter 分支里留着一份旧版 README
The starter branch keeps an older README that adds the remote again at this point.

449
00:27:46,412 --> 00:27:48,294
在这一步又加一次 remote
The starter branch keeps an older README that adds the remote again at this point.

450
00:27:48,614 --> 00:27:51,558
这会失败：remote origin 已经存在
That fails: remote origin already exists.

451
00:27:51,878 --> 00:27:54,117
课程 pin 住的那版 README 说不要这么做
The pinned README says not to.

452
00:27:54,167 --> 00:27:58,301
再做一个额外的实验，只看，不要在真的挂载上跑
One extra experiment, to watch, not to run on a real mount:

453
00:27:58,301 --> 00:28:02,785
在我们的替身目录上，用 git checkout 出旧的指针文件
on our stand-in folder, check out the old pointer file with git,

454
00:28:02,785 --> 00:28:06,779
跑 dvc checkout，目录里又变回四张照片
run dvc checkout, and the folder holds four photos again.

455
00:28:07,099 --> 00:28:10,107
回到 main，又是五张，来自磁盘上的缓存
Back to main, and five, from the cache on disk.

456
00:28:10,427 --> 00:28:14,272
用真的挂载时，这个目录就是你 bucket 的 images 目录
With a real mount, this folder is your bucket's images folder,

457
00:28:14,272 --> 00:28:17,125
所以 checkout 会在那里删除并重写照片
so checkout deletes and rewrites photos there.

458
00:28:21,300 --> 00:28:23,258
现在来看从任何地方做时间旅行
Now, time travel from anywhere:

459
00:28:23,258 --> 00:28:29,321
这是课上的说法，指回到之前的某个版本，前提是它的文件还保留着
the lecture's phrase for reaching an earlier version, which works only while its files are kept.

460
00:28:29,641 --> 00:28:33,097
命令 dvc get 带上一个 tag，就会顺着这根绳子走
The command dvc get, with a tag, walks the rope.

461
00:28:33,417 --> 00:28:35,418
它在那个 tag 上 clone 这个 repo
It clones the repo at that tag,

462
00:28:35,418 --> 00:28:38,386
读那个 commit 的配置找到 bucket
reads that commit's config to find the bucket,

463
00:28:38,386 --> 00:28:41,161
然后取 manifest，再取照片
then fetches the manifest, then the photos.

464
00:28:41,400 --> 00:28:44,536
打开 README 里的 notebook，保存一份副本
Open the notebook from the README and save a copy.

465
00:28:44,856 --> 00:28:49,656
装 DVC、加载库，再用你的 Google 账号登录
Install DVC, load the libraries, and sign in with your Google account.

466
00:28:49,976 --> 00:28:53,325
然后列出一个 repo，取一个版本，数一数文件
Then list a repo, fetch a version, and count the files.

467
00:28:53,567 --> 00:28:56,141
我们的替身没有登录
Our stand-in is not signed in,

468
00:28:56,141 --> 00:29:01,546
而 pip 给它装了一个更新的 DVC，录制时是 3.67.1
and pip gives it a newer DVC, 3.67.1, at the time of recording.

469
00:29:01,866 --> 00:29:05,746
列出课程的 repo 时报了 401，看看是在哪儿
Listing the class repo fails with a 401, and look where:

470
00:29:05,746 --> 00:29:10,804
在 manifest 那一步，因为 DVC 先取列表，按绳子的顺序来
at the manifest, because DVC fetches the list first, in the rope's order.

471
00:29:13,517 --> 00:29:18,274
授课老师登录后的那次运行，在课程 repo 上列出五个文件
The instructor's signed-in run lists five files on the class repo,

472
00:29:18,274 --> 00:29:21,517
和它的 v21 版本是同一组，数出来是 5
the same set as its version 21, and counts 5.

473
00:29:21,837 --> 00:29:25,078
你的账号多半访问不了课程的 bucket
Your account probably cannot access the class bucket,

474
00:29:25,078 --> 00:29:26,578
所以用你自己的 repo
so use your repo:

475
00:29:26,578 --> 00:29:28,745
换掉地址和 tag
replace the address and the tag;

476
00:29:28,745 --> 00:29:30,370
你的 v20 版本会得到 4
your version 20 gives 4.

477
00:29:30,690 --> 00:29:32,115
你的 repo 是私有的
Your repo is private,

478
00:29:32,115 --> 00:29:35,640
所以要在地址里放一个访问令牌，或者把它设成公开
so put an access token in the address, or make it public.

479
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:37,560
暂停一下，一步步做完
Pause and work through it.

480
00:29:38,150 --> 00:29:39,750
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

481
00:29:39,814 --> 00:29:44,913
第 19 个单元格悄悄地要 dataset v25，什么都没打印
Cell 19 asks quietly for dataset_v25, and prints nothing.

482
00:29:45,233 --> 00:29:46,833
它成功了吗？
Did it work?

483
00:29:53,050 --> 00:29:56,527
没有。下一个单元格失败了：没有这个目录
No. The next cell fails: no such folder.

484
00:29:56,847 --> 00:30:00,986
去掉 --quiet 参数，错误就出来了：未知的 Git 修订版本
Without the --quiet flag, the error appears: unknown Git revision.

485
00:30:01,306 --> 00:30:05,893
课程的 repo 只有 v20、v21 和 v30 这几个 tag
The class repo only has tags v20, v21 and v30.

486
00:30:06,213 --> 00:30:09,605
存下来的计数 3 是以前某次运行留下的
The stored count of 3 is left over from an older run;

487
00:30:09,605 --> 00:30:11,781
--quiet 参数连错误也一起藏起来了
the --quiet flag hides errors too.

488
00:30:13,817 --> 00:30:16,804
快速预测一下：三个问题，三个工具
A quick prediction: three questions, three tools.

489
00:30:17,124 --> 00:30:20,900
把 Delta Lake 或 Iceberg、DVC 和 lakeFS 配对上去
Match Delta Lake or Iceberg, DVC, and lakeFS.

490
00:30:25,734 --> 00:30:28,913
DVC、lakeFS，然后是表格式
DVC, lakeFS, then the table formats.

491
00:30:29,233 --> 00:30:34,224
没有统一的标准；你的项目里程碑接受这样的轻量工具
There is no single standard; your project milestone accepts a light tool like this.

492
00:30:34,467 --> 00:30:40,355
课上最后讲监控：盯住质量、新鲜度、漂移、成本和出错的步骤
The lecture ends with monitoring: watch quality, freshness, drift, cost and broken steps.

493
00:30:40,675 --> 00:30:45,070
版本管理告诉你改了什么；监控告诉你有东西变了
Versioning tells you what changed; monitoring tells you that something changed.

494
00:30:45,317 --> 00:30:46,707
放在一张地图上看
On one map:

495
00:30:46,707 --> 00:30:50,565
Label Studio 跑在 container 里，替照片签票
Label Studio runs in a container and signs tickets for the photos.

496
00:30:50,885 --> 00:30:54,256
配在 bucket 上的一条规则，让浏览器的保安放行
A rule on the bucket satisfies the browser's bouncer.

497
00:30:54,576 --> 00:30:58,458
每条 label 是一张小纸条；挂载的 bucket 给 DVC 供数据
Labels are small notes; a mounted bucket feeds DVC.

498
00:30:58,778 --> 00:31:02,490
照片按指纹归档；一个 tag 锁定这份列表
Photos are filed by fingerprint; a tag pins the list.

499
00:31:02,810 --> 00:31:06,536
所以周一的照片用一次 dvc get 就能拿回来
So Monday's photos come back with one dvc get;

500
00:31:06,536 --> 00:31:09,210
它们的 label 会在练习 E7 里接上
their labels join in exercise E7.

501
00:31:09,450 --> 00:31:11,455
五道自测题
5 questions to test yourself.

502
00:31:11,775 --> 00:31:16,298
第一题：谁去取照片，bucket 为什么需要它的 CORS 规则？
One: who fetches the photos, and why does the bucket need its CORS rule?

503
00:31:16,618 --> 00:31:19,242
第二题：命令行 container 和你的浏览器
Two: why can't the command line container

504
00:31:19,242 --> 00:31:21,290
为什么不能互换地址？
and your browser swap addresses?

505
00:31:21,610 --> 00:31:25,514
第三题：指针文件里有什么，改名时什么会变？
Three: what is in the pointer file, and what changes on a rename?

506
00:31:25,834 --> 00:31:28,159
第四题：push 之后，字节都在哪儿？
Four: where do the bytes sit after a push?

507
00:31:28,479 --> 00:31:32,512
第五题：没有 DVC store，dvc get 会怎样？
Five: without the dvc_store, what does dvc get do?

508
00:31:37,534 --> 00:31:41,075
清理就是 README 的三条命令；暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
Cleanup is the README's three commands; pause and run them.

509
00:31:41,395 --> 00:31:45,449
如果你保留标注用的 bucket，就用 -r 删掉它的 CORS 规则
If you keep the labeling bucket, remove its CORS rule with -r.

510
00:31:45,769 --> 00:31:48,598
每个 bucket 都会一直花钱，直到你删掉它
Buckets cost money until you delete them,

511
00:31:48,598 --> 00:31:52,945
但绝不要删 DVC store，只要还有哪个 tag 要用
but never delete the dvc_store while any tag should still work;

512
00:31:52,945 --> 00:31:54,601
一个 tag 只是一个指针
a tag is only a pointer.

513
00:31:54,921 --> 00:31:58,632
把密钥和它的 JSON 文件删掉，等课程结束的时候
Delete the key and its JSON file when the course is done.

514
00:31:58,867 --> 00:32:00,915
答案在练习里
Answers are in the exercises.

515
00:32:01,235 --> 00:32:03,814
第 13 讲用一个准备好的 zip 来训练
Lecture 13 trains from a prepared zip;

516
00:32:03,814 --> 00:32:07,208
要是用打了 tag 的版本，那次运行就能复现
a tagged version would make that run reproducible.
